%% Phase1 / post / MV3-G01h 发送任务卡
%% 机器真源: cses-client phase1.manifest.json；TaskApiService/buildTaskCardMessage；Helix im_send_message；Go posts/create；Angular MessageTaskContentComponent
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as TaskApiService / MessageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri im_send_message
  participant E as Helix Tick / im_send_message
  participant Java as Java CSES
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink im:__bus__
  participant Store as Angular message store
  participant View as MessageTaskContentComponent
  UI->>Gate: TaskApiService.create POST /taskManage/task/create
  Gate->>Java: CreateTaskDto
  Java-->>Gate: taskId
  UI->>Gate: sendTaskCardById(taskId)
  Gate->>Java: POST /taskManage/task/detail
  Java-->>Gate: TaskDetail
  Gate->>Gate: buildTaskCardMessage(type=TASK_CARD, props.taskCard/taskCardBlock)
  Gate->>Native: MessageService.sendMessage
  Native->>E: Tick::Command(im_send_message)
  E->>DB: Persist optimistic message(sending)
  DB-->>E: PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>Sink: im:post:sending
  E->>Go: Effect::Http POST /api/cses/posts/create
  Go->>PG: post/channel/channel_member/channel_event
  Go-->>E: HTTP 2xx admission
  Go-->>WS: post
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(post)
  E->>DB: PersistAtomic canonical message/channel/cursor
  DB-->>E: PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>Sink: im:post:received
  Sink->>Store: IpcEventService upsert TASK_CARD
  Store->>View: props.taskCard signal 渲染任务卡
  Note over UI,View: 创建任务与发送任务卡是两段链路；离线先保留 sending 投影，权威 post 回声后才成为 sent
